flowchart TD
  CLI[User runs `pytron run`] --> APP[`pytron.application`]
  APP --> ROUTER[`pytron.router` resolves route]
  ROUTER --> ENGINE[Select Engine (native/chrome/servo)]
  ENGINE --> WEBVIEW[`pytron.webview` initializes]
  WEBVIEW --> NATIVE[Native engine process / wry/tokio]
  NATIVE --> IPC[IPC bridge (framed messages)]
  IPC --> JS[Injected JS bridge (`pytron://` protocol)]
  JS --> PLUGINS[Plugin APIs exposed to JS]
  PLUGINS --> APP
  APP --> UI[Render UI in webview]
